---
title: Shipment State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WaitingToPick : PO issued, warehouse portion waiting for its picking list
    WaitingToPick --> Ready : warehouse RunPickingList reaches Ready (shipment created)
    WaitingToPick --> Exception : warehouse RunPickingList is in NeedsHandling
    Ready --> Issued : stock issued at dispatch confirmation
    Ready --> Exception : Operator flags exception (reason required)
    Issued --> Delivering : driver and vehicle assigned, shipment departs
    Issued --> Exception : Operator flags exception after issue (reason required)
    Delivering --> Received : Retailer confirms full receipt of this portion
    Delivering --> Exception : Retailer confirms receipt with shortage or damage
    Exception --> Ready : Administrator resolves pre-dispatch exception (portion re-picked)
    Exception --> Received : Administrator closes post-delivery exception, discrepancy handled by claim
    Received --> [*]
